- Kesehatan jiwa.

122
00:07:16,686 --> 00:07:19,813
Kau punya minat
pada bidang itu, 'kan?

123
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:23,109
Aku tak akan menyebutnya minat.
Itu lebih seperti...

124
00:07:26,821 --> 00:07:27,822
Astaga.

125
00:07:30,283 --> 00:07:31,409
Kau mungkin benar.

126
00:07:34,245 --> 00:07:36,623
- Kau genius, Whitaker.
- Baiklah.

127
00:07:38,333 --> 00:07:39,709
CTG terpasang.

128
00:07:40,418 --> 00:07:41,335
CTG?

129
00:07:41,336 --> 00:07:44,380
Kardiotokografi,
mengukur detak jantung bayimu

130
00:07:44,381 --> 00:07:46,048
dan memeriksa kontraksi.

131
00:07:46,049 --> 00:07:49,094
Denyut janin 128.
Berapa denyut normal. Nazely?

132
00:07:49,719 --> 00:07:50,971
110 sampai 160.

133
00:07:51,596 --> 00:07:52,930
Jadi, bayiku sehat?

134
00:07:52,931 --> 00:07:55,557
Saat ini, ya. 128 itu normal.

135
00:07:55,558 --> 00:07:59,645
TD 170/119.
6 gram magnesium diberikan.

136
00:07:59,646 --> 00:08:01,105
Langkah berikutnya, Crus?

137
00:08:01,106 --> 00:08:03,899
20 mg labetalol,
lewat infus selama dua menit.

138
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:07,528
- Apa yang terjadi?
- Kau mengalami preeklamsia.

139
00:08:07,529 --> 00:08:10,823
