- Belum pernah ditemukan.

140
00:08:10,824 --> 00:08:12,992
Terjadi pada sekitar 10% kehamilan.

141
00:08:12,993 --> 00:08:15,661
Tekanan darah tinggi,
sakit kepala, protein dalam urine,

142
00:08:15,662 --> 00:08:17,079
dan kaki bengkak.

143
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:20,792
Ini kehamilan alami,
jadi tak perlu perawatan medis.

144
00:08:21,751 --> 00:08:23,169
Lalu kenapa kau kemari?

145
00:08:25,255 --> 00:08:27,298
Aku ingin meredakan sakit kepalaku.

146
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:32,594
Jika tekanan darah tidak diturunkan

147
00:08:32,595 --> 00:08:34,973
dan berikan magnesium,
akan ada masalah.

148
00:08:35,557 --> 00:08:36,682
Seperti apa?

149
00:08:36,683 --> 00:08:40,519
Kejang, pendarahan, bahkan kematian.
Bagimu dan si bayi.

150
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,396
Astaga.

151
00:08:42,397 --> 00:08:45,358
- Robby, temanmu siap pulang.
- Ya, segera ke sana.

152
00:08:46,276 --> 00:08:48,235
- Kau bisa?
- Ya. Aku bisa.

153
00:08:48,236 --> 00:08:49,487
Dengan mata terpejam.

154
00:08:50,488 --> 00:08:51,906
Tidak. Mungkin satu mata.

155
00:08:53,074 --> 00:08:54,117
Hei...

156
00:08:57,579 --> 00:08:58,996
Becca, bagaimana keadaanmu?

157
00:08:58,997 --> 00:09:00,457
<i>Lebih baik. Terima kasih.</i>

158
00:09:02,876 --> 00:09:05,295
- Kau di mana?
<i>- Di rumah Adam.</i>

159
00:09:06,087 --> 00:09:08,338
<i>Bisa kutelepon nanti?
Kami menonton film.</i>

160
00:09:08,339 --> 00:09:10,674
Tentu. Kukira
kau mau lihat kembang api.

161
00:09:10,675 --> 00:09:13,094
<i>Tidak. Kami memutuskan menonton</i> Elf.

162
00:09:14,554 --> 00:09:15,472
Tentu saja.

163
00:09:16,139 --> 00:09:17,598
<i>Kutelepon besok.</i>

164
00:09:17,599 --> 00:09:20,018
Besok? Tunggu. Kau menginap di sana?

165
00:09:21,394 --> 00:09:23,521
<i>Ya. Orang tuanya mengundangku.</i>

166
00:09:24,147 --> 00:09:25,689
Mereka harus minta izinku.

167
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,317
<i>Kau juga menginap di sini?</i>

168
00:09:28,234 --> 00:09:32,154
Tidak. Mereka harus tanya
apa aku mengizinkan kau menginap.

169
00:09:32,155 --> 00:09:32,989
<i>Kenapa?</i>

170
00:09:34,574 --> 00:09:36,033
Karena...

171
00:09:36,034 --> 00:09:36,910
itu...

172
00:09:37,911 --> 00:09:40,622
sopan... Itu tindakan yang benar.

173
00:09:42,332 --> 00:09:43,582
Sambungkan dengan mereka.

174
00:09:43,583 --> 00:09:45,668
<i>Mereka tak ada di sini,
ada pesta barbeku.</i>

175
00:09:46,503 --> 00:09:49,755
Baiklah. Bisa minta
mereka meneleponku saat pulang?

176
00:09:49,756 --> 00:09:50,798
<i>Ya.</i>

177
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:52,424
- Janji?
<i>- Aku janji.</i>

178
00:09:52,425 --> 00:09:54,803
<i>- Baiklah. Dah, Mel.</i>
- Dah. Bergembira...

179
00:09:56,304 --> 00:09:57,721
Terima kasih soal motorku.

180
00:09:57,722 --> 00:10:00,058
Kau merawatku, aku memperbaikinya.

181
00:10:02,102 --> 00:10:05,687
Orang Cree tak punya ucapan
untuk berpamitan.

182
00:10:05,688 --> 00:10:06,940
Kau kenal orang Cree?

183
00:10:07,732 --> 00:10:10,777
- Sedikit. Aku bersosialisasi.
- Aku tak meragukannya.

184
00:10:13,571 --> 00:10:16,323
Aku akan kembali untuk tes lainnya.

185
00:10:16,324 --> 00:10:17,366
Bagus.

186
00:10:17,367 --> 00:10:20,619
Jika kau janji akan kembali
dan izinkan kendarai Bonnie.

187
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:23,122
Entahlah. Aku pernah
melihatmu berkendara, Pak Tua.

188
00:10:23,123 --> 00:10:24,040
Awas kau.

189
00:10:24,666 --> 00:10:25,667
Aku serius.

190
00:10:26,668 --> 00:10:27,710
Kita sepakat?

191
00:10:30,964 --> 00:10:31,965
Akan kupikirkan.

192
00:10:46,146 --> 00:10:47,980
Sepertinya ini sergapan.

193
