476
00:24:06,862 --> 00:24:09,489
Kau tangani si bayi.
Nazely tangani pernapasan.

477
00:24:09,490 --> 00:24:11,532
Kau tangani pengisapan.
Siap intubasi.

478
00:24:11,533 --> 00:24:12,659
Retraktor kemih.

479
