Jantung tak memompa. Tak ada denyut.

534
00:26:41,892 --> 00:26:43,059
Lanjutkan kompresi.

535
00:26:43,060 --> 00:26:45,937
Transfusi dua unit lagi.
Butuh sel darah merah dan trombosit.

536
00:26:45,938 --> 00:26:47,563
Ada pendarahan dari uterus.

537
00:26:47,564 --> 00:26:49,108
Ambilkan semua perban.

538
00:26:56,657 --> 00:27:00,369
Ya. Terima kasih.
Aku menghargainya, Henny.

